      <common:generalComment>Dataset developed according to Arcadia project Methodology (Report: “Metodologia per gli studi di filiera della Banca Dati italiana LCA”). LCA study of ornamental stone (Report: “Studio LCA della filiera delle pietre ornamentali”). The dataset refers to the production average limestone slab.</common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="ba3fdae3-2064-41e6-b287-eaf5838839bf" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/ba3fdae3-2064-41e6-b287-eaf5838839bf.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Background datasets from Ecoinvent database cut-off (v.3.8) were used for the LCA study.</common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
